  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup all-purpose flour",
    "2 tablespoons white sugar",
    "2 teaspoons baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon salt, or to taste",
    "1 cup milk",
    "2 tablespoons vegetable oil",
    "1 egg, beaten"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ThAj9gCLeNnnX3LD-5NyVNokVHw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/45396-easy-pancakes-ddmfs-3196-4x3-step-01-6cb60c7686464be3910e7f06fbcf459f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/45396/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, sugar, baking powder, and salt in a large bowl; make a well in the center. Pour in milk, oil, and egg; mix until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/L8TYf8LiKoWzVlPobkf-XKxucio=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/45396-easy-pancakes-mfs-step-1-04-a04b59250c48485984976abafb751df7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/45396/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a lightly oiled griddle or frying pan over medium-high heat. Pour or scoop about ¼ cup batter per pancake onto the griddle; cook until bubbles form and the edges are dry, 1 to 2 minutes. Flip; cook until browned on the other side. Repeat with remaining batter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/id8_qt25l-LBPcQYKFrrbv2dlsM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/45396-easy-pancakes-mfs-step-3-13-26d8d4b6dcc9450eb29075d984aa7a1a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/45396/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
